#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0310B expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "No column matching ^SMQ(\\d{2})SC$ or ^SMQ(\\d{2})SCN$. Scope pre-gate passes (declared OCCDS/ADVERSE EVENT), then the expander drops the rule: tryExpand returns NoMatch -> SKIPPED: Template did not match any columns in dataset. THE BATCH'S SINGLE PIN on wildcard NoMatch for the SMQzzSC family; AD0311B shares the identical mechanism and gets no duplicate."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS subclass=AE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AESEQ   type=Num
col AEDECOD type=Char
col AESEV   type=Char
col AESEVN  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE | MILD | 1
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | 1 | NAUSEA   | MILD | 2
